# Ayni148check pure probe'un ayri sifir hedef rotasi. Taslak secimi native kanit degildir.
# Iki haftada bir transfer,12. hesapta son200 kisi; garnizon etkisi13. hesapta kalkar.
new
lang ru
wait 0.4
shot 00-start
establishment budget 0
expect HasArmyEstablishment True
expect ArmyTargetTroops 0
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 2
expect Troops 1200
expect Manpower 2400
state 01-zero-policy-signed
panel establishment
wait 0.4
shot 01-zero-target-applied-ru
scroll document 800
wait 0.3
shot 02-zero-garrison-warning-ru
lang tr
scroll document 800
wait 0.3
shot 03-zero-garrison-warning-tr
save
remember zero-scheduled
load
same zero-scheduled
week
expect Week 1
expect Troops 1200
expect Manpower 2400
expect Gold 911
expect Food 362
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 2
week
expect Week 2
expect PendingPetition True
expect Troops 1000
expect Manpower 2600
expect Gold 979
expect Food 362
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 4
state 02-first-zero-target-batch
petition negotiate
week
expect Week 3
expect Troops 1000
expect Manpower 2600
expect Gold 1076
expect Food 367
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 4
week
expect Week 4
expect Troops 800
expect Manpower 2800
expect Gold 1170
expect Food 370
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 6
state 03-second-batch
week
week
expect Week 6
expect Troops 600
expect Manpower 3000
expect Gold 1383
expect Food 385
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 8
state 04-third-batch
panel establishment
scroll document 650
wait 0.4
shot 04-half-size-policy-tr
save
remember halfway
select normandy
load
same halfway
week
week
expect Week 8
expect Troops 400
expect Manpower 3200
expect Gold 1617
expect Food 407
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 10
state 05-fourth-batch
week
week
expect Week 10
expect Troops 200
expect Manpower 3400
expect Gold 1870
expect Food 433
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 12
state 06-last-garrison-awaits
panel establishment
lang ru
scroll document 650
wait 0.4
shot 05-last-garrison-warning-ru
week
expect Week 11
expect Troops 200
expect Gold 2009
expect Food 451
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 12
expect ArmyCost 53
expect ArmyConsumption 7
state 07-last-old-army-budget
week
expect Week 12
expect Troops 0
expect Manpower 3600
expect Gold 2144
expect Food 467
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 0
expect ArmyPolicyId budget
expect ArmyTargetTroops 0
expect HasArmyEstablishment True
expect HasDumasInitiative False
expect ArmyCost 0
expect ArmyConsumption 0
state 08-zero-after-old-garrison-settlement
save
remember zero-completed
select normandy
load
same zero-completed
state 09-zero-completed-loaded
panel establishment
scroll document 650
wait 0.4
shot 06-zero-reached-ru
# Bu hesap ilk kez ordusuz/garnizonsuzdur; state08 ile bolgesel fark ayrica okunur.
week
expect Week 13
expect Troops 0
expect Manpower 3600
expect Gold 2328
expect Food 488
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 0
expect HasDumasInitiative False
expect ArmyCost 0
expect ArmyConsumption 0
state 10-first-week-without-garrison
panel economy
wait 0.4
shot 07-first-week-without-garrison-ru
mode army
wait 1.2
shot 10-no-army-overlay
# Sefer serbestisi politikasi, sonra ayni200 kisilik olağan recruit; oyun sonu yok.
establishment campaign 0
act recruit
expect ArmyPolicyId campaign
expect HasArmyEstablishment False
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 0
expect Troops 200
expect Manpower 3400
expect Gold 2208
expect Food 468
expect ArmyCost 53
expect ArmyConsumption 7
state 11-recruited-after-zero
save
remember recovered
load
same recovered
state 12-recruited-after-zero-loaded
panel journal
lang tr
wait 0.6
shot 08-recovery-journal-tr
lang ru
wait 0.3
shot 09-recovery-journal-ru
wait 1.2
shot 11-restored-army-overlay
quit
